     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif\">So I have this R script that can produce a scatter plot with labels of each point. Sth like this:</p><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10px;padding:5px;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:18px\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,serif\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;<a href=\"http://blog.gettyimages.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/Siberian-Tiger-Running-Through-Snow-Tom-Brakefield-Getty-Images-200353826-001-628x419.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://blog.gettyimages.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/Siberian-Tiger-Running-Through-Snow-Tom-Brakefield-Getty-Images-200353826-001-628x419.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371559296000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12siuJ2ymU39_ezYG3VDsR\">http://blog.gettyimages.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/Siberian-Tiger-Running-Through-Snow-Tom-Brakefield-Getty-Images-200353826-001-628x419.jpg</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nimg2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;<a href=\"http://blog.gettyimages.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/Hurricane-Sandy-Andrew-Burton-Getty-Images-154986556.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://blog.gettyimages.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/Hurricane-Sandy-Andrew-Burton-Getty-Images-154986556.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371559296000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0I2jxwD0uQpoeV2gzkr_c5\">http://blog.gettyimages.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/Hurricane-Sandy-Andrew-Burton-Getty-Images-154986556.jpg</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nimgdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">frame</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">c</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">img2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\ncolnames</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">imgdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;images&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\ntxtdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">frame</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">c</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;A&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;B&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;C&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;D&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;E&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;F&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;G&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;H&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;I&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;J&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\nplotdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">frame</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">seq</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">:</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">10</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">seq</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">11</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">:</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">20</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">txtdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">imgdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\ncolnames</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plotdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">c</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;var1&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;var2&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;texts&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;images&quot;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\nggplot</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plotdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> aes</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plotdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">[,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">],</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plotdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">[,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">]))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">+</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> \r\n  geom_point</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">data</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plotdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> aes</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plotdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">[,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">],</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plotdata</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">[,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">]))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">+</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n  geom_text</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">aes</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">label</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">plotdata$points</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">size</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> hjust</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">))</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif\">This gives a scatter plot, where each point is labelled as &quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;C&quot;... etc.<br></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-gW9yASUoY-s/UrdOM-PHICI/AAAAAAAAAAM/QNKRt5RvaXQ/s1600/exm.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-gW9yASUoY-s/UrdOM-PHICI/AAAAAAAAAAM/QNKRt5RvaXQ/s1600/exm.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371559296000&amp;usg=AOvVaw04XDoLk56BHJ8IjH2qt0zy\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-gW9yASUoY-s/UrdOM-PHICI/AAAAAAAAAAM/QNKRt5RvaXQ/s320/exm.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;clear:both;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,&#39;Liberation Sans&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">What I want to do is almost the same, except instead of texts, I want to label each point with the image that are in the links of a vector or data frame (in this case in &quot;imgdata&quot;). Note that I selected these images just as examples; I have much more of them (all external), so I can&#39;t manually download them.</span><br></p><p></p></div>"
